<title>USA: BanPonce Trust I sets $150 mln capital securities.</title>
<headline>BanPonce Trust I sets $150 mln capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities from BanPonce Trust I, guaranteed by BanPonce Corp, was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANPONCE TRUST I</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 8.327 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAP SECS	ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 08/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD  8.327 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 145 BP     CALLABLE  NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>NOTES: STANDARD MAKE-WHOLE CALL</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
